---
import "../styles/global.css";
import SiteNav from "../components/SiteNav.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Privacy — Switchback</title>
    <meta name="description" content="What stays on your machine, what your agent's model provider sees, and what Switchback collects (nothing)." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SiteNav />
    <main class="privacy">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>

      <p>
        Everything Switchback makes for you stays in a <code>switchback/</code> folder inside your
        own working directory: the specs it builds from, the HTML and PDF it prints, the photos
        you send back, and the read-backs written from them. None of it is uploaded anywhere by
        the CLI or the skill.
      </p>

      <p>
        Your saved desk (paper size, printer, pens) lives in your own user config directory —
        <code>switchback profile --path</code> shows exactly where — and stays there until you
        change it yourself.
      </p>

      <p>
        To read your handwriting back from a photo, the agent sends that photo to the AI model it
        runs on, the same way it would handle any image you shared with it directly in
        conversation. That transfer is between you and your agent's model provider; Switchback
        itself has no server in the loop and never sees the photo.
      </p>

      <p>
        The site you are reading now, and the CLI behind it, collect nothing: no analytics, no
        cookies, no trackers, and no third-party scripts of any kind in the production build. There
        is no account to create and no mailing list to join.
      </p>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a href="/changelog/">Changelog</a>
      <a href="/privacy/" aria-current="page">Privacy</a>
      <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@vandermerwed/switchback">npm</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body {
    background: var(--sb-paper);
    color: var(--sb-ink);
    font-family: var(--sb-font-body);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem;
  }
  .site-nav,
  .site-footer {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .site-nav a,
  .site-footer a {
    color: #dce8df;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .site-nav a:hover,
  .site-footer a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .privacy {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .privacy h1 {
    font-family: var(--sb-font-heading);
    color: var(--sb-ink);
  }
  .privacy code {
    font-family: var(--sb-font-mono);
    background: var(--sb-rule);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: 0.25em;
  }
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sb-rule);
    color: #dce8df;
  }
</style>
